---
/*
  GridPaper — faint graph-paper motif behind all content (it's math). Theme-aware via the
  --grid-line / --grid-size tokens; a soft radial mask fades it toward the edges so it reads
  as texture, not a table. Sits above the physics canvas (-z-20) and below content.
*/
---

<div
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="grid-paper pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10"
  style="mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 90% at 50% 0%, black 40%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 90% at 50% 0%, black 40%, transparent 100%);"
>
</div>
